{"mode":"words","text":"Ovenfor ser du en tekst akkurat slik appen viser den. Hvert ord er et lite kort: øverst står ordet på målspråket, under det står betydningen på morsmålet ditt — ord for ord, i målspråkets rekkefølge. Under det står hele setningen oversatt i en flytende tekst. For språk med et annet skriftsystem legges det til en linje med transkripsjon, slik at du kan lese alt. Trykk på et ord: Stemmen fortsetter avspillingen akkurat derfra.","words":[{"s":0,"e":697},{"s":789,"e":1057},{"s":1091,"e":1173},{"s":1242,"e":1324},{"s":1405,"e":1858},{"s":1950,"e":2415},{"s":2450,"e":2752},{"s":2844,"e":3228},{"s":3309,"e":3785},{"s":3820,"e":4214},{"s":5364,"e":5817},{"s":5979,"e":6304},{"s":6385,"e":6583},{"s":6664,"e":6734},{"s":6815,"e":7117},{"s":7198,"e":7930},{"s":8464,"e":9067},{"s":9149,"e":9509},{"s":9625,"e":10008},{"s":10054,"e":10205},{"s":10298,"e":11749},{"s":12098,"e":12469},{"s":12504,"e":12736},{"s":12783,"e":13096},{"s":13177,"e":13944},{"s":14025,"e":14141},{"s":14234,"e":15011},{"s":15046,"e":15383},{"s":15499,"e":15696},{"s":16544,"e":16939},{"s":17020,"e":17333},{"s":17461,"e":18018},{"s":18413,"e":18576},{"s":18692,"e":19934},{"s":20097,"e":21292},{"s":21919,"e":22372},{"s":22419,"e":22662},{"s":22697,"e":23034},{"s":23115,"e":23487},{"s":23568,"e":24288},{"s":24450,"e":25263},{"s":25379,"e":25426},{"s":25518,"e":25635},{"s":25797,"e":26621},{"s":26714,"e":27527},{"s":28154,"e":28363},{"s":28409,"e":29210},{"s":29385,"e":29652},{"s":29698,"e":29849},{"s":30011,"e":30406},{"s":30476,"e":31649},{"s":31811,"e":32252},{"s":32322,"e":32519},{"s":32566,"e":32670},{"s":32705,"e":32786},{"s":32902,"e":33425},{"s":33518,"e":33796},{"s":33843,"e":35282},{"s":35677,"e":36014},{"s":36095,"e":36176},{"s":36211,"e":36316},{"s":36385,"e":36536},{"s":36618,"e":37012},{"s":37082,"e":37825},{"s":38278,"e":38649},{"s":38742,"e":38835},{"s":38916,"e":38998},{"s":39160,"e":39810},{"s":40344,"e":41006},{"s":41099,"e":41865},{"s":41947,"e":42817},{"s":42945,"e":43